text = "In The Depths - A video game that merges idle clicker and rogue-like gameplay. Visit the website [url=https://gremloid.github.io/In-The-Depths-Website/][color=yellow]HERE[/color][/url].

Blueprints of the Mind - A pixel drawing program with a simple design. Visit the website [url=https://tomasurena.github.io/Blueprints-of-The-Mind/][color=yellow]HERE[/color][/url].
"

